# Finding Frank in the Monastery's cells (Milestone 20b, escape start).
# Plays on stepping onto the rune in front of his cell.

face player up
emote frank !
say Frank: Oh, thank the Light - somebody's awake! You there, the monk. Get me out of here?
narrate The lock is old and crusted with something dark. One sharp strike and it gives way.
face frank down
say Frank: Frank. Just Frank. A traveling merchant - or I was, before they dragged me in here with the rest of their... collection.
emote player ?
say Frank: The way out is past the great hall, and there's a master on guard there. Quick hands. Faster than anything should be.
say Frank: Watch for when it settles into its guard - strike into that and it'll strike you right back. Wait it out. I'll be right behind you.
set met_frank
narrate Frank falls in behind you.
despawn frank
